    }, CancellationToken.None);
}
```

**Question**: What happens when `userId` is NOT a board member? `targetRole` will be null. The owner-guard `if` is false (null != BoardRole.Owner). `DeleteAsync` is called with a userId that has no board_members row. The DELETE affects 0 rows. No error is thrown. The caller receives 204 No Content.

